<title>SWEDEN: H&amp;M rises on Oct retail sales figures.</title>
<headline>H&amp;M rises on Oct retail sales figures.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in clothing retailer Hennes &amp; Mauritz traded 3.2 percent higher on news of a jump in Swedish October retail sales from a market research institute.</p>
<p>At 1130 the share traded at 997 crowns, up 31 on Thursday's close. The share touched 999 crowns, its all-time high, earlier in the day.</p>
<p>Swedish market research institute HUI said retail sales rose four percent in October compared to October 1995, news agency TT said. HUI figures showed clothing sales rose even more -- eight percent -- in October.</p>
<p>Official statistics published on Wednesday showed Swedish retail sales rose 2.1 percent in September.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
